/S /H3
/P 94 0 R
/T (A ping from App-A \(10.10.2.10\) to App-B \(10.20.1.10\) leaves the private subnet. ewb-rt-a-private matches 10.20.0.0/16 and sends it to the peering connection pcx-0b40275e45e3598c6. In VPC B the packet reaches ewb-b-private, and ewb-sg-app-b allows ICMP Echo Request from 10.10.2.10/32.)
/E (A ping from App-A \(10.10.2.10\) to App-B \(10.20.1.10\) leaves the private subnet. ewb-rt-a-private matches 10.20.0.0/16 and sends it to the peering connection pcx-0b40275e45e3598c6. In VPC B the packet reaches ewb-b-private, and ewb-sg-app-b allows ICMP Echo Request from 10.10.2.10/32.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
313 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 94 0 R
/T (Return path)
/E (Return path)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
314 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 94 0 R
/T (The reply goes from 10.20.1.10 to 10.10.2.10. ewb-rt-b-private matches 10.10.0.0/16 and sends it back over the same peering connection. Security groups are stateful, so the reply is allowed automatically. Without this return route the ping would still fail, because a one-way route is not enough.)
/E (The reply goes from 10.20.1.10 to 10.10.2.10. ewb-rt-b-private matches 10.10.0.0/16 and sends it back over the same peering connection. Security groups are stateful, so the reply is allowed automatically. Without this return route the ping would still fail, because a one-way route is not enough.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
315 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 94 0 R
/T (Why the SSH source on App-B is the bastion private IP)
/E (Why the SSH source on App-B is the bastion private IP)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
316 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 94 0 R
/T (With ProxyJump the bastion opens a second SSH connection to App-B, so App-B sees 10.10.1.10 as the source. The public route table also needs 10.20.0.0/16 -> pcx so that the bastion can reach VPC B.)
/E (With ProxyJump the bastion opens a second SSH connection to App-B, so App-B sees 10.10.1.10 as the source. The public route table also needs 10.20.0.0/16 -> pcx so that the bastion can reach VPC B.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
