318 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 94 0 R
/T (Active peering does not guarantee a ping: route tables and security groups must also allow it \(Figures 11-18 prove this\). VPC B cannot use VPC A's internet gateway over peering, because peering is non-transitive and does not provide internet access.)
/E (Active peering does not guarantee a ping: route tables and security groups must also allow it \(Figures 11-18 prove this\). VPC B cannot use VPC A's internet gateway over peering, because peering is non-transitive and does not provide internet access.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
