328 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 95 0 R
/T (1\) A VPC peering connection needs routes on both sides. 2\) Security groups on the destination must allow the peer's private IP. 3\) The address AWS sees for my laptop can differ from the address shown by a lookup website. 4\) Testing a failure first, and then fixing it, proves which component makes the connection work.)
/E (1\) A VPC peering connection needs routes on both sides. 2\) Security groups on the destination must allow the peer's private IP. 3\) The address AWS sees for my laptop can differ from the address shown by a lookup website. 4\) Testing a failure first, and then fixing it, proves which component makes the connection work.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
