/Title (At first ssh ewb-bastion timed out even though my SG rule contained the IP shown by checkip.amazonaws.com. My network reaches IPv4 hosts through carrier NAT, so the bastion saw a different source address. I temporarily widened the rule to find the address, read it on the bastion with journalctl -u sshd \(it was 152.59.62.39\), and then narrowed the rule to 152.59.62.39/32. The rule is never opened to 0.0.0.0/0.)
